                <semantic:textAnnotation id="_0ed9d14c-871c-4245-9f34-e7210f8ea366">
                    <semantic:text>Data Objects

Order:
Description: Records of customer orders.
Attributes: Order ID, customer ID, product ID, order quantity, order date, delivery date.

Promotional Activities:
Description: Information on marketing and promotional activities.
Attributes: Promotion ID, product ID, promotion start date, promotion end date, discount rate.

Product Information:
Description: Details about the products.
Attributes: Product ID, product name, category, price, lifecycle stage.

Data Quality Metrics:
Description: Metrics evaluating the quality of data.
Attributes: Completeness, accuracy, consistency, timeliness.</semantic:text>
                </semantic:textAnnotation>
