            <semantic:textAnnotation id="_df3e22df-71df-492e-b9ef-3040182f8ab1">
                <semantic:text>Calculate the reorder point based on lead time demand and safety stock.
Incorporate factors such as lead time, average demand, and demand variability.
Set reorder points for different inventory items, considering their specific characteristics and demand patterns.</semantic:text>
            </semantic:textAnnotation>
